ps the stdin handle so\nthe event loop drains naturally, with a short backstop if native handles linger.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt><a href=\"#runAudioWorker\">runAudioWorker(inputData)</a> ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;void&gt;</code></dt>\n<dd><p>Dispatches the requested audio operation (processor/metadata/dna/stats).</p>\n</dd>\n<dt><a href=\"#startAudioWorker\">startAudioWorker()</a> ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;any&gt;</code></dt>\n<dd><p>Runs the worker job and, only inside a spawned worker thread, finishes the process.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n\n<a name=\"finishWorker\"></a>\n\n## finishWorker(code)\nEnds the worker process once the job is done: drops the stdin handle so\nthe event loop drains naturally, with a short backstop if native handles linger.\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| code | <code>number</code> | Exit code for the worker process. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/audio/worker/index.ts:19  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/audio/worker/index.js:8\n<a name=\"runAudioWorker\"></a>\n\n## runAudioWorker(inputData) ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;void&gt;</code>\nDispatches the requested audio operation (processor/metadata/dna/stats).\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| inputData | <code>AudioWorkerData</code> | Worker dispatch data (defaults to the spawned worker's workerData). |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/audio/worker/index.ts:30  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/audio/worker/index.js:13\n<a name=\"startAudioWorker\"></a>\n\n## startAudioWorker() ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;any&gt;</code>\nRuns the worker job and, only inside a spawned worker thread, finishes the process.\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n**Returns**: <code>Promise&lt;any&gt;</code> - The worker job promise (resolved when the job has been dispatched).  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/audio/worker/index.ts:51  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/audio/worker/index.js:29\n","symbols":3,"lastUsed":1795079874752},"tdata:packages/backend/src/resources/audio/worker/inspect.ts":{"doclets":[{"id":"metadata","longname":"metadata","name":"metadata","kind":"function","scope":"global","description":"// eslint-disable-next-line jsdoc/require-param-description","params":[{"description":"Description.","name":"inputData","type":{"names":["AudioWorkerData"]}}],"meta":{"lineno":10},"order":0,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/resources/audio/worker/inspect.js:5","src":"packages/backend/src/resources/audio/worker/inspect.ts:15"},"returns":[{"type":{"names":["Promise<void>"]}}],"level":0},{"id":"stats","longname":"stats","name":"stats","kind":"function","scope":"global","description":"// eslint-disable-next-line jsdoc/require-param-description","params":[{"description":"Description.","name":"inputData","type":{"names":["AudioWorkerData"]}}],"meta":{"lineno":37},"order":1,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/resources/audio/worker/inspect.js:27","src":"packages/backend/src/resources/audio/worker/inspect.ts:44"},"returns":[{"type":{"names":["Promise<void>"]}}],"level":0}],"fp":"0cacc3bb3c6aa5de69a02e61117b33840c6de5dfdd2dc32c115ec98acee61317","issues":[],"kind":"tdata","lastUsed":1795079874689,"symbols":0},"md:packages/backend/src/resources/audio/worker/inspect.ts":{"fp":"2f41d24860743e0a11ad689ed306cd824392326685cb0681a9a5f8356327d63f","issues":[],"kind":"md","markdown":"## Functions\n\n<dl>\n<dt><a href=\"#metadata\">metadata(inputData)</a> ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;void&gt;</code></dt>\n<dd><p>// eslint-disable-next-line jsdoc/require-param-description</p>\n</dd>\n<dt><a href=\"#stats\">stats(inputData)</a> ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;void&gt;</code></dt>\n<dd><p>// eslint-disable-next-line jsdoc/require-param-description</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n\n<a name=\"metadata\"></a>\n\n## metadata(inputData) ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;void&gt;</code>\n// eslint-disable-next-line jsdoc/require-param-description\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| inputData | <code>AudioWorkerData</code> | Description. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/audio/worker/inspect.ts:15  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/audio/worker/inspect.js:5\n<a name=\"stats\"></a>\n\n## stats(inputData) ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;void&gt;</code>\n// eslint-disable-next-line jsdoc/require-param-description\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| inputData | <code>AudioWorkerData</code> | Description. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/audio/worker/inspect.ts:44  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/audio/worker/inspect.js:27\n","symbols":2,"lastUsed":1795079874782},"tdata:packages/backend/src/resources/audio/worker/processor.ts":{"doclets":[{"id":"processMedia","longname":"processMedia","name":"processMedia","kind":"function","scope":"global","description":"Transcodes the upload stdin into the requested format/codec/bitrate and streams it out.","params":[{"description":"Output settings from the request query.","name":"payload"},{"description":"Worker dispatch data (defaults to the spawned worker's workerData).","name":"inputData","type":{"names":["AudioWorkerData"]}}],"meta":{"lineno":65},"order":0,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/resources/audio/worker/processor.js:60","src":"packages/backend/src/resources/audio/worker/processor.ts:22"},"returns":[{"type":{"names":["Promise<void>"]}}],"level":0}],"fp":"daffdb2d0fb0ef701676011b21c50308283bf74f13207ea507bd0363fda6656a","issues":[],"kind":"tdata","lastUsed":1795079874699,"symbols":0},"md:packages/backend/src/resources/audio/worker/processor.ts":{"fp":"0fa007266030e2d16e051863e575af259f989ff8114571249d2b32db92879f9c","issues":[],"kind":"md","markdown":"<a name=\"processMedia\"></a>\n\n## processMedia(payload, inputData) ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;void&gt;</code>\nTranscodes the upload stdin into the requested format/codec/bitrate and streams it out.\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| paylo