description":"Extracts every glyph's coverage and identity plus the supported OpenType features.","memberof":"FontService","params":[{"description":"The validated query object.","name":"query","type":{"names":["{ font?: string; limit?: number; }"]}},{"description":"Optional collection member to select by PostScript name.","name":"query.font"},{"description":"Optional cap on the number of returned glyph records.","name":"query.limit"}],"returns":[{"description":"The extraction document (could be large for CJK fonts).","type":{"names":["Promise<{ availableFeatures: string[]; collection: string[]; familyName: string; format: string; glyphs: Record<string, unknown>[]; numGlyphs: number; postscriptName: string; returnedGlyphs: number; }>"]}}],"meta":{"lineno":208},"async":true,"order":4,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/resources/font/font.service.js:208 (approx.)","src":"packages/backend/src/resources/font/font.service.ts:176"},"level":0},{"id":"FontService#metadata","longname":"FontService#metadata","name":"metadata","kind":"function","scope":"instance","description":"Reads the uploaded font (ClamAV-scanned, signature-gated) and normalizes its metadata.","memberof":"FontService","params":[{"description":"The validated query object.","name":"query","type":{"names":["{ font?: string; }"]}},{"description":"Optional collection member to select by PostScript name.","name":"query.font"}],"returns":[{"description":"The font metadata document.","type":{"names":["Promise<{ ascent: number; availableFeatures: string[]; bbox: fontkit.BBOX; capHeight: number; characterSetSize: number; collection: string[]; copyright: string; descent: number; embedding: { bitmapOnly: boolean; editable: boolean; noEmbedding: boolean; noSubsetting: boolean; viewOnly: boolean; }; familyName: string; format: string; fullName: string; italicAngle: number; license: string; licenseURL: string; lineGap: number; namedVariations: Record<string, unknown>; numGlyphs: number; postscriptName: string; subfamilyName: string; underlinePosition: number; underlineThickness: number; unitsPerEm: number; variationAxes: Partial<Record<string, { name: string; min: number; default: number; max: number; }>>; version: number; weightClass: number; xHeight: number; }>"]}}],"meta":{"lineno":260},"async":true,"order":5,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/resources/font/font.service.js:260 (approx.)","src":"packages/backend/src/resources/font/font.service.ts:226"},"level":0},{"id":"FontService#shape","longname":"FontService#shape","name":"shape","kind":"function","scope":"instance","description":"Shapes text with the font's OpenType engine.","memberof":"FontService","params":[{"description":"The validated query object.","name":"query","type":{"names":["{ direction?: \"auto\" | \"ltr\" | \"rtl\"; features?: string; font?: string; language?: string; script?: string; text: string; }"]}},{"description":"Optional direction override; defaults to the script default.","name":"query.direction"},{"description":"Optional `+tag`/`-tag`/`tag` comma-separated feature overrides.","name":"query.features"},{"description":"Optional collection member to select by PostScript name.","name":"query.font"},{"description":"Optional language override; defaults to the script default.","name":"query.language"},{"description":"Optional script override; defaults to detection.","name":"query.script"},{"description":"The text to shape.","name":"query.text"}],"returns":[{"description":"The glyph run with positions and aggregate metrics.","type":{"names":["Promise<{ advanceHeight: number; advanceWidth: number; bbox: fontkit.BBOX; direction: string; features: Record<string, boolean>; format: string; glyphs: { xAdvance: number; yAdvance: number; xOffset: number; yOffset: number; advanceWidth: number; codePoints: number[]; id: number; isLigature: boolean; isMark: boolean; name: string; }[]; language: string; script: string; }>"]}}],"meta":{"lineno":282},"async":true,"order":6,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/resources/font/font.service.js:282 (approx.)","src":"packages/backend/src/resources/font/font.service.ts:248"},"level":0},{"id":"FontService#subset","longname":"FontService#subset","name":"subset","kind":"function","scope":"instance","description":"Subsets the font to the glyphs needed for the given text.\nThe output is a minimal sfnt intended for PDF embedding (no cmap); it is not\na standalone web font.","memberof":"FontService","params":[{"description":"The validated query object.","name":"query","type":{"names":["{ font?: string; text: string; }"]}},{"description":"Optional collection member to select by PostScript name.","name":"query.font"},{"description":"The text whose glyphs are kept.","name":"query.text"}],"returns":[{"description":"The subsetted sfnt bytes.","type":{"names":["Promise<Buffer<ArrayBuffer>>"]}}],"meta":{"lineno":327},"async":true,"order":7,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/resources/font/font.service.js:327 (approx.)","src":"packages/backend/src/resources/font/font.service.ts:306"},"level":0}],"fp":"60cc81bf3ac224b9046a71198f15bdcf010b803622f2e2f3b9bbb8951e590581","issues":[],"kind":"tdata","symbols":0,"lastUsed":1795079890706},"md:packages/backend/src/resources/font/font.service.ts":{"fp":"cf19b4773c34fc4bc3bf758991f637367f91264f4af011d385367c8b5ce62a95","issues":["dist sourcemap missing or unmatched — dist line is an approximation"],"kind":"md","markdown":"## Members\n\n<dl>\n<dt><a href=\"#FontService\">FontService</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Font feature service: parses sfnt containers (metadata, extraction, shaping, subsetting).</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n\n## Constants\n\n<dl>\n<dt><a href=\"#signatureFormat\">signatureFormat</a> ⇒ <code>string</code></dt>\n<dd><p>Maps the file&#39;s magic bytes to a short format tag.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n\n## Functions\n\n<dl>\n<dt><a href=\"#readBody\">readBody(cls)</a> ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;Buffer&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;&gt;</code></dt>\n<dd><p>Only font container mimes; macro/executable payloads are rejected at the boundary.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt><a href=\"#assertFontSignature\">assertFontSignature(buffer)</a> ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;void&gt;</code></dt>\n<dd><p>Signature must be a font container; closes the renamed-image and non-font holes.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt><a href=\"#parseFeatures\">parseFeatures(raw)</a> ⇒ <code>Record&lt;string, boolean&gt;</code></dt>\n<dd><p>Parses &#39;liga,kern,-dlig&#39; into a fontkit features record (enabled default, &#39;-&#39; disables).\nUnknown 4-character tags pass through to the shaper (it ignores them); malformed tags are a client error.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n\n<a name=\"FontService\"></a>\n\n## FontService\nFont feature service: parses sfnt containers (metadata, extraction, shaping, subsetting).\n\n**Kind**: global variable  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/font/font.service.ts:166  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/font/font.service.js:183 (approx.)\n\n* [FontService](#FontService)\n    * [.extract(query)](#FontService+extract) ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;{ availableFeatures: string[]; collection: string[]; familyName: string; format: string; glyphs: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;[]; numGlyphs: number; postscriptName: string; returnedGlyphs: number; }&gt;</code>\n    * [.metadata(query)](#FontService+metadata) ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;{ ascent: number; availableFeatures: string[]; bbox: fontkit.BBOX; capHeight: number; characterSetSize: number; collection: string[]; copyright: string; descent: number; embedding: { bitmapOnly: boolean; editable: boolean; noEmbedding: boolean; noSubsetting: boolean; viewOnly: boolean; }; familyName: string; format: string; fullName: string; italicAngle: number; license: string; licenseURL: string; lineGap: number; namedVariations: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;; numGlyphs: number; postscriptName: string; subfamilyName: string; underlinePosition: number; underlineThickness: number; unitsPerEm: number; variationAxes: Partial&lt;Record&lt;string, { name: string; min: number; default: number; max: number; }&gt;&gt;; version: number; weightClass: number; xHeight: number; }&gt;</code>\n    * [.shape(query)](#FontService+shape) ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;{ advanceHeight: number; advanceWidth: number; bbox: fontkit.BBOX; direction: string; features: Record&lt;string, boolean&gt;; format: string; glyphs: { xAdvance: number; yAdvance: number; xOffset: number; yOffset: number; advanceWidth: number; codePoints: number[]; id: number; isLigature: boolean; isMark: boolean; name: string; }[]; language: string; script: string; }&gt;</code>\n    * [.subset(query)](#FontService+subset) ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;Buffer&lt;ArrayBuffer&gt;&gt;</code>\n\n<a name=\"FontService+extract\"></a>\n\n### fontService.extract(query) ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;{ availableFeatures: string[]; collection: string[]; familyName: string; format: string; glyphs: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;[]; numGlyphs: number; postscriptName: string; returnedGlyphs: number; }&gt;</code>\nExtracts every glyph's coverage and identity plus the supported OpenType features.\n\n**Kind**: instance method of [<code>FontService</code>](#FontService)  \n**Returns**: <code>Promise&lt;{ availableFeatures: string[]; collection: string[]; familyName: string; format: string; glyphs: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;[]; numGlyphs: number; postscriptName: string; returnedGlyphs: number; }&gt;</code> - The extraction document (could be large for CJK fonts).  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| query | <code>{ font?: string; limit?: number; }</code> | The validated query object. |\n| query.font |  | Optional collection member to select by PostScript name. |\n| query.limit |  | Optional cap on the number of returned glyph records. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/font/font.service.ts:176  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/font/font.service.js:208 (approx.)\n<a name=\"FontService+metadata\"></a>\n\n### fontService.metadata(query) ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;{ ascent: number; availableFeatures: string[]; bbox: fontkit.BBOX; capHeight: number; characterSetSize: number; collection: string[]; copyright: string; descent: number; embedding: { bitmapOnly: boolean; editable: boolean; noEmbedding: boolean; noSubsetting: boolean; viewOnly: boolean; }; familyName: string; format: string; fullName: string; italicAngle: number; license: string; licenseURL: string; lineGap: number; namedVariations: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;; numGlyphs: number; postscriptName: string; subfamilyName: string; underlinePosition: number; underlineThickness: number; unitsPerEm: number; variationAxes: Partial&lt;Record&lt;string, { name: string; min: number; default: number; max: number; }&gt;&gt;; version: number; weightClass: number; xHeight: number; }&gt;</code>\nReads the uploaded font (ClamAV-scanned, signature-gated) and normalizes its metadata.\n\n**Kind**: instance method of [<code>FontService</code>](#FontService)  \n**Returns**: <code>Promise&lt;{ ascent: number; availableFeatures: string[]; bbox: fontkit.BBOX; capHeight: number; characterSetSize: number; collection: string[]; copyright: string; descent: number; embedding: { bitmapOnly: boolean; editable: boolean; noEmbedding: boolean; noSubsetting: boolean; viewOnly: boolean; }; familyName: string; format: string; fullName: string; italicAngle: number; license: string; licenseURL: string; lineGap: number; namedVariations: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;; numGlyphs: number; postscriptName: string; subfamilyName: string; underlinePosition: number; underlineThickness: number; unitsPerEm: number; variationAxes: Partial&lt;Record&lt;string, { name: string; min: number; default: number; max: number; }&gt;&gt;; version: number; weightClass: number; xHeight: number; }&gt;</code> - The font metadata document.  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| query | <code>{ font?: string; }</code> | The validated query object. |\n| query.font |  | Optional collection member to select by PostScript name. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/font/font.service.ts:226  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/font/font.service.js:260 (approx.)\n<a name=\"FontService+shape\"></a>\n\n### fontService.shape(query) ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;{ advanceHeight: number; advanceWidth: number; bbox: fontkit.BBOX; direction: string; features: Record&lt;string, boolean&gt;; format: string; glyphs: { xAdvance: number; yAdvance: number; xOffset: number; yOffset: number; advanceWidth: number; codePoints: number[]; id: number; isLigature: boolean; isMark: boolean; name: string; }[]; language: string; script: string; }&gt;</code>\nShapes text with the font's OpenType engine.\n\n**Kind**: instance method of [<code>FontService</code>](#FontService)  \n**Returns**: <code>Promise&lt;{ advanceHeight: number; advanceWidth: number; bbox: fontkit.BBOX; direction: string; features: Record&lt;string, boolean&gt;; format: string; glyphs: { xAdvance: number; yAdvance: number; xOffset: number; yOffset: number; advanceWidth: number; codePoints: number[]; id: number; isLigature: boolean; isMark: boolean; name: string; }[]; language: string; script: string; }&gt;</code> - The glyph run with positions and aggregate metrics.  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| query | <code>{ direction?: &quot;auto&quot; \\| &quot;ltr&quot; \\| &quot;rtl&quot;; features?: string; font?: string; language?: string; script?: string; text: string; }</code> | The validated query object. |\n| query.direction |  | Optional direction override; defaults to the script default. |\n| query.features |  | Optional `+tag`/`-tag`/`tag` comma-separated feature overrides. |\n| query.font |  | Optional collection member to select by PostScript name. |\n| query.language |  | Optional language override; defaults to the script default. |\n| query.script |  | Optional script override; defaults to detection. |\n| query.text |  | The text to shape. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/font/font.service.ts:248  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/font/font.service.js:282 (approx.)\n<a name=\"FontService+subset\"></a>\n\n### fontService.subset(query) ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;Buffer&lt;ArrayBuffer&gt;&gt;</code>\nSubsets the font to the glyphs needed for the given text.\nThe output is a minimal sfnt intended for PDF embedding (no cmap); it is not\na standalone web font.\n\n**Kind**: instance method of [<code>FontService</code>](#FontService)  \n**Returns**: <code>Promise&lt;Buffer&lt;ArrayBuffer&gt;&gt;</code> - The subsetted sfnt bytes.  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| query | <code>{ font?: string; text: string; }</code> | The validated query object. |\n| query.font |  | Optional collection member to select by PostScript name. |\n| query.text |  | The text whose glyphs are kept. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/font/font.service.ts:306  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/font/font.service.js:327 (approx.)\n<a name=\"signatureFormat\"></a>\n\n## signatureFormat ⇒ <code>string</code>\nMaps the file's magic bytes to a short format tag.\n\n**Kind**: global constant  \n**Returns**: <code>string</code> - The format tag (ttf, otf, woff, woff2).  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| buffer | <code>Buffer&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;</code> | The buffered upload. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/font/font.service.ts:107  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/font/font.service.js:80\n<a name=\"readBody\"></a>\n\n## readBody(cls) ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;Buffer&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;&gt;</code>\nOnly font container mimes; macro/executable payloads are rejected at the boundary.\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n**Returns**: <code>Promise&lt;Buffer&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;&gt;</code> - The body bytes, capped.  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| cls | <code>NormalizedClsService</code> | Normalized request context. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/font/font.service.ts:21  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/font/font.service.js:18\n<a name=\"assertFontSignature\"></a>\n\n## assertFontSignature(buffer) ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;void&gt;</code>\nSignature must be a font container; closes the renamed-image and non-font holes.\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| buffer | <code>Buffer&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;</code> | The buffered upload. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/font/font.service.ts:39  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/font/font.service.js:31\n<a name=\"parseFeatures\"></a>\n\n## parseFeatures(raw) ⇒ <code>Record&lt;string, boolean&gt;</code>\nParses 'liga,kern,-dlig' into a fontkit features record (enabled default, '-' disables).\nUnknown 4-character tags pass through to the shaper (it ignores them); malformed tags are a client error.\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n**Returns**: <code>Record&lt;string, boolean&gt;</code> - The features record, or undefined when no features were given.  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| raw | <code>string</code> | The raw feature string from the query. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/font/font.service.ts:345  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/font/font.service.js:369 (approx.)\n","symbols":9,"lastUsed":1795079890775},"tdata:packages/backend/src/resources/image/image-signature.interceptor.spec.ts":{"doclets":[],"fp":"955ade092a1162e023100989dca2d424550a052bb39b9b8cde156c8c5102e8a3","issues":[],"kind":"tdata","lastUsed":1795079890474,"symbols":0},"md:packages/backend/src/resources/image/image-signature.interceptor.spec.ts":{"fp":"826265d9ccfd9cd818ba6e783901b5f6464b18a6193ea2ea2380b66bc8f3d7d2","issues":["dist file not found — dist: line omitted (build first)"],"kind":"md","skipped":"no-jsdoc","symbols":0,"lastUsed":1795079890479},"tdata:packages/backend/src/resources/image/dna.spec.ts":{"doclets":[{"id":"jpegStream","longname":"jpegStream","name":"jpegStream","kind":"function","scope":"global","description":"Opens a fresh readable stream over the JPEG fixture.","params":[],"returns":[{"description":"A readable stream of the fixture bytes.","type":{"names":["Readable"]}}],"meta":{"lineno":14},"order":0,"mdaics":{"src":"packages/backend/src/resources/image/dna.spec.ts:18"},"level":0},{"id":"makeService","longname":"makeService","name":"makeService","kind":"function","scope":"global","description":"Builds an ImageService with stubbed dependencies for DNA tests.","params":[{"description":"The file signature returned by the stubbed CLS store.","name":"signature","type":{"names":["unknown"]}},{"description":"Factory opening a fresh input stream per call.","name":"streamFactory","type":{"names":["() => Readable"]}},{"description":"Whether the stubbed file-type check passes.","name":"isImage","defaultvalue":true,"type":{"names":["boolean"]}}],"returns":[{"description":"An ImageService wired to the stubs.","type":{"names":["ImageService"]}}],"meta":{"lineno":24},"order":1,"mdaics":{"src":"packages/backend/src/resources/image/dna.spec.ts:29"},"level":0},{"id":"<anonymous>~chunks","longname":"<anonymous>~chunks","name":"chunks","kind":"function","scope":"inner","description":"Yields 21 one-MiB chunks to exceed the 20 MiB cap.","meta":{"lineno":75},"yields":[{"description":"A 1 MiB zero-filled chunk."}],"memberof":"<anonymous>","params":[],"generator":true,"order":2,"mdaics":{"src":"packages/backend/src/resources/image/dna.spec.ts:86"},"returns":[{"type":{"names":["Generator<Buffer<ArrayBufferLike>, any, any>"]}}]}],"fp":"1a6149478910deb0690b12d66a9d7bcb90d75c027391c8105029fdc72df0a3cc","issues":[],"kind":"tdata","lastUsed":1795079890385,"symbols":0},"md:packages/backend/src/resources/image/dna.spec.ts":{"fp":"161eb3e7939bd8f61d6d1dd114834150d409cabc6f5dc70dcf0e6c6b29fdeb87","issues":["dist file not found — dist: line omitted (build first)"],"kind":"md","markdown":"## Functions\n\n<dl>\n<dt><a href=\"#jpegStream\">jpegStream()</a> ⇒ <code>Readable</code></dt>\n<dd><p>Opens a fresh readable stream over the JPEG fixture.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt><a href=\"#makeService\">makeService(signature, streamFactory, isImage)</a> ⇒ <code>ImageService</code></dt>\n<dd><p>Builds an ImageService with stubbed dependencies for DNA tests.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n\n<a name=\"jpegStream\"></a>\n\n## jpegStream() ⇒ <code>Readable</code>\nOpens a fresh readable stream over the JPEG fixture.\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n**Returns**: <code>Readable</code> - A readable stream of the fixture bytes.  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/image/dna.spec.ts:18  \n<a name=\"makeService\"></a>\n\n## makeService(signature, streamFactory, isImage) ⇒ <code>ImageService</code>\nBuilds an ImageService with stubbed dependencies for DNA tests.\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n**Returns**: <code>ImageService</code> - An ImageService wired to the stubs.  \n\n| Param | Type | Default | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| signature | <code>unknown</code> |  | The file signature returned by the stubbed CLS store. |\n| streamFactory | <code>() &#x3D;&gt; Readable</code> |  | Factory opening a fresh input stream per call. |\n| isImage | <code>boolean</code> | <code>true</code> | Whether the stubbed file-type check passes. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/image/dna.spec.ts:29  \n","symbols":3,"lastUsed":1795079890433},"tdata:packages/backend/src/resources/image/image-signature.interceptor.ts":{"doclets":[{"id":"ImageSignatureInterceptor","longname":"ImageSignatureInterceptor","name":"ImageSignatureInterceptor","kind":"member","scope":"global","description":"Rejects /image requests whose probed signature is not an image mime (runs after the signature scan).","params":[],"meta":{"lineno":37},"order":0,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/resources/image/image-signature.interceptor.js:37 (approx.)","src":"packages/backend/src/resources/image/image-signature.interceptor.ts:14"},"level":0}],"fp":"5d70b033d45c760d62204a473223ca10cd4bb082dcf5160b796bf22c4d875f71","issues":[],"kind":"tdata","symbols":0,"lastUsed":1795079890776},"md:packages/backend/src/resources/image/image-signature.interceptor.ts":{"fp":"f432fcd