n (accepts true/false/1/0/yes/no/on/off, case-insensitive).</p>\n</dd>\n<dt><a href=\"#ModelOptimizeSchema\">ModelOptimizeSchema</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Flat query parameters for <code>POST /model/optimize</code>.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt><a href=\"#ModelConvertSchema\">ModelConvertSchema</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Flat query parameters for <code>POST /model/convert</code>.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt><a href=\"#ModelMetadataSchema\">ModelMetadataSchema</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Flat query parameters for <code>POST /model/metadata</code> (empty; rejects junk params).</p>\n</dd>\n<dt><a href=\"#ModelExtractSchema\">ModelExtractSchema</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Flat query parameters for <code>POST /model/extract</code> (empty; rejects junk params).</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n\n<a name=\"compress\"></a>\n\n## compress\nCompression codec for mesh data; `none` keeps uncompressed accessors.\n\n**Kind**: global variable  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/model/schema.ts:13  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/model/schema.js:6\n<a name=\"simplify\"></a>\n\n## simplify\nLossy simplification ratio in [0, 1]; 1 (default) disables it. Values < 1 force weld on.\n\n**Kind**: global variable  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/model/schema.ts:15  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/model/schema.js:7\n<a name=\"weld\"></a>\n\n## weld\nWeld bitwise-identical vertices (forced on when simplify < 1); default on.\n\n**Kind**: global variable  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/model/schema.ts:21  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/model/schema.js:12\n<a name=\"to\"></a>\n\n## to\n`glb`: binary container. `gltf`: self-contained JSON container with data URIs.\n\n**Kind**: global variable  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/model/schema.ts:31  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/model/schema.js:17\n<a name=\"MODEL_MIME\"></a>\n\n## MODEL\\_MIME\nOnly the binary glTF container; .gltf JSON with external resources is not accepted.\n\n**Kind**: global constant  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/model/schema.ts:4  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/model/schema.js:2\n<a name=\"boolParam\"></a>\n\n## boolParam\nHouse-standard query boolean (accepts true/false/1/0/yes/no/on/off, case-insensitive).\n\n**Kind**: global constant  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/model/schema.ts:7  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/model/schema.js:3\n<a name=\"ModelOptimizeSchema\"></a>\n\n## ModelOptimizeSchema\nFlat query parameters for `POST /model/optimize`.\n\n**Kind**: global constant  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/model/schema.ts:10  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/model/schema.js:4\n<a name=\"ModelConvertSchema\"></a>\n\n## ModelConvertSchema\nFlat query parameters for `POST /model/convert`.\n\n**Kind**: global constant  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/model/schema.ts:28  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/model/schema.js:15\n<a name=\"ModelMetadataSchema\"></a>\n\n## ModelMetadataSchema\nFlat query parameters for `POST /model/metadata` (empty; rejects junk params).\n\n**Kind**: global constant  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/model/schema.ts:38  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/model/schema.js:20\n<a name=\"ModelExtractSchema\"></a>\n\n## ModelExtractSchema\nFlat query parameters for `POST /model/extract` (empty; rejects junk params).\n\n**Kind**: global constant  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/model/schema.ts:40  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/model/schema.js:21\n","symbols":10,"lastUsed":1795079891461},"tdata:packages/backend/src/resources/model/worker/index.ts":{"doclets":[{"id":"finishWorker","longname":"finishWorker","name":"finishWorker","kind":"function","scope":"global","description":"Commits the worker's exit code; stdout exit is deferred so flush can complete.","params":[{"description":"The exit code to report.","name":"code","type":{"names":["number"]}}],"meta":{"lineno":10},"order":0,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/resources/model/worker/index.js:6","src":"packages/backend/src/resources/model/worker/index.ts:18"},"level":0}],"fp":"4598c3bec1eb656d9a074ed31ef97a9be42354901074b17a39a487ca07fa56a2","issues":[],"kind":"tdata","lastUsed":1795079891435,"symbols":0},"md:packages/backend/src/resources/model/worker/index.ts":{"fp":"9b21fde98d878b816e7bd97303caacc160dbf9d48695d57f11b127d663137ab2","issues":[],"kind":"md","markdown":"<a name=\"finishWorker\"></a>\n\n## finishWorker(code)\nCommits the worker's exit code; stdout exit is deferred so flush can complete.\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| code | <code>number</code> | The exit code to report. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/model/worker/index.ts:18  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/model/worker/index.js:6\n","symbols":1,"lastUsed":1795079891488},"tdata:packages/backend/src/resources/model/worker/worker.spec.ts":{"doclets":[],"fp":"369bfc8c24311ade33f480efe3178a4662a1524271b46ea1df803543fcc8e04a","issues":[],"kind":"tdata","lastUsed":1795079891494,"symbols":0},"md:packages/backend/src/resources/model/worker/worker.spec.ts":{"fp":"39014d370ee4a99e86c9a18de5fbcfb82a9f18da240904c673f3ad17584d468f","issues":["dist file not found — dist: line omitted (build first)"],"kind":"md","skipped":"no-jsdoc","symbols":0,"lastUsed":1795079891494},"tdata:packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/builder.ts":{"doclets":[{"id":"buildPdfDocument","longname":"buildPdfDocument","name":"buildPdfDocument","kind":"constant","scope":"global","description":"Builds the PDF document body as bytes. Pages are created up front so the\ntotal logical page count (including `pageBreak` segments) is known before\nany element is drawn. Fonts and images are embedded before drawing, so the\ndraw pass is fully synchronous.\n\nCoordinate convention: every `y` is a distance from the page's top edge,\nin points (1 pt = 1/72 inch). For `text` and `pageNumber`, `y` is the distance\nto the top of the first text line's em box; the baseline is at\n`pageHeight - y - size` and every line advances by `size * 1.2`. Lines, rects,\nellipses, images, fields and tables take `y` as the distance to the element's\ntop edge; `line` endpoints are absolute distances from the top.","params":[{"description":"Validated build payload.","name":"body","type":{"names":["{ pages: { elements: ({ [x: string]: any; text: string; type: \"text\"; x: number; y: number; align?: \"left\" | \"center\" | \"right\"; font?: string; size?: number; w?: number; } | { [x: string]: any; h: number; type: \"rect\"; w: number; x: number; y: number; dash?: boolean; strokeWidth?: number; } | { [x: string]: any; h: number; type: \"ellipse\"; w: number; x: number; y: number; strokeWidth?: number; } | { [x: string]: any; type: \"line\"; x1: number; x2: number; y1: number; y2: number; dash?: boolean; thickness?: number; } | { data: string; h: number; imageType: \"png\" | \"jpg\"; type: \"image\"; w: number; x: number; y: number; opacity?: number; } | { rows: (string | { [x: string]: any; text: string; align?: \"left\" | \"center\" | \"right\"; colSpan?: number; size?: number; })[][]; type: \"table\"; w: number; x: number; y: number; colWidths?: number[]; header?: boolean; } | { [x: string]: any; fieldType: \"text\" | \"checkbox\"; type: \"field\"; x: number; y: number; h?: number; value?: string; w?: number; } | { [x: string]: any; format: string; type: \"pageNumber\"; x: number; y: number; font?: string; size?: number; } | { type: \"pageBreak\"; })[]; margin: { bottom: number; left: number; right: number; top: number; }; orientation: \"portrait\" | \"landscape\"; size: \"a4\" | \"a3\" | \"a5\" | \"letter\" | \"legal\" | \"tabloid\"; }[]; embeddedFonts?: { [x: string]: any; data: string; }[]; metadata?: { author?: string; creationDate?: string; creator?: string; keywords?: string | string[]; language?: string; subject?: string; title?: string; }; }"]}}],"returns":[{"description":"The .pdf bytes.","type":{"names":["Promise<Uint8Array<ArrayBufferLike>>"]}}],"meta":{"lineno":114},"order":0,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/resources/pdf/builder.js:93","src":"packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/builder.ts:132"},"level":0}],"fp":"b2b07b688203bf7036cdc6504cf0a22b5bd6cd9d937bcc864e31d363b854f4e2","issues":[],"kind":"tdata","lastUsed":1795079891505,"symbols":0},"md:packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/builder.ts":{"fp":"92afbe8dc9db22c1e8c3dda4fbf221fe17062b7e13faaf1e5e813da8b62b2f10","issues":[],"kind":"md","markdown":"<a name=\"buildPdfDocument\"></a>\n\n## buildPdfDocument ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;Uint8Array&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;&gt;</code>\nBuilds the PDF document body as bytes. Pages are created up front so the\ntotal logical page count (including `pageBreak` segments) is known before\nany element is drawn. Fonts and images are embedded before drawing, so the\ndraw pass is fully synchronous.\n\nCoordinate convention: every `y` is a distance from the page's top edge,\nin points (1 pt = 1/72 inch). For `text` and `pageNumber`, `y` is the distance\nto the top of the first text line's em box; the baseline is at\n`pageHeight - y - size` and every line advances by `size * 1.2`. Lines, rects,\nellipses, images, fields and tables take `y` as the distance to the element's\ntop edge; `line` endpoints are absolute distances from the top.\n\n**Kind**: global constant  \n**Returns**: <code>Promise&lt;Uint8Array&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;&gt;</code> - The .pdf bytes.  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| body | <code>{ pages: { elements: ({ [x: string]: any; text: string; type: &quot;text&quot;; x: number; y: number; align?: &quot;left&quot; \\| &quot;center&quot; \\| &quot;right&quot;; font?: string; size?: number; w?: number; } \\| { [x: string]: any; h: number; type: &quot;rect&quot;; w: number; x: number; y: number; dash?: boolean; strokeWidth?: number; } \\| { [x: string]: any; h: number; type: &quot;ellipse&quot;; w: number; x: number; y: number; strokeWidth?: number; } \\| { [x: string]: any; type: &quot;line&quot;; x1: number; x2: number; y1: number; y2: number; dash?: boolean; thickness?: number; } \\| { data: string; h: number; imageType: &quot;png&quot; \\| &quot;jpg&quot;; type: &quot;image&quot;; w: number; x: number; y: number; opacity?: number; } \\| { rows: (string \\| { [x: string]: any; text: string; align?: &quot;left&quot; \\| &quot;center&quot; \\| &quot;right&quot;; colSpan?: number; size?: number; })[][]; type: &quot;table&quot;; w: number; x: number; y: number; colWidths?: number[]; header?: boolean; } \\| { [x: string]: any; fieldType: &quot;text&quot; \\| &quot;checkbox&quot;; type: &quot;field&quot;; x: number; y: number; h?: number; value?: string; w?: number; } \\| { [x: string]: any; format: string; type: &quot;pageNumber&quot;; x: number; y: number; font?: string; size?: number; } \\| { type: &quot;pageBreak&quot;; })[]; margin: { bottom: number; left: number; right: number; top: number; }; orientation: &quot;portrait&quot; \\| &quot;landscape&quot;; size: &quot;a4&quot; \\| &quot;a3&quot; \\| &quot;a5&quot; \\| &quot;letter&quot; \\| &quot;legal&quot; \\| &quot;tabloid&quot;; }[]; embeddedFonts?: { [x: string]: any; data: string; }[]; metadata?: { author?: string; creationDate?: string; creator?: string; keywords?: string \\| string[]; language?: string; subject?: string; title?: string; }; }</code> | Validated build payload. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/builder.ts:132  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/pdf/builder.js:93\n","symbols":1,"lastUsed":1795079891558},"tdata:packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/elements.spec.ts":{"doclets":[],"fp":"ee55b082fb6c3655055ef84e645da891990444e234bbb26163f7e47e7ebb4b39","issues":[],"kind":"tdata","lastUsed":1795079891532,"symbols":0},"md:packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/elements.spec.ts":{"fp":"d447801fd1051d804c85ca8e2d1e424423419bcb2a6f10b033ea44d1463ebb77","issues":["dist file not found — dist: line omitted (build first)"],"kind":"md","skipped":"no-jsdoc","symbols":0,"lastUsed":1795079891532},"tdata:packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.contro