The /Count value written into the pages object.","name":"pageCount","type":{"names":["number"]}},{"description":"The raw MediaBox array for the single page object.","name":"mediaBox","defaultvalue":"[0 0 200 200]","type":{"names":["string"]}}],"returns":[{"description":"The raw bytes of the hand-crafted PDF.","type":{"names":["Buffer<ArrayBufferLike>"]}}],"meta":{"lineno":221},"order":0,"mdaics":{"src":"packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.service.spec.ts:259"},"level":0}],"fp":"22275997628822fd97d2c9e47edba37fc741166f8a90d68805e5da6d7f725652","issues":[],"kind":"tdata","lastUsed":1795079891749,"symbols":0},"md:packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.service.spec.ts":{"fp":"466e4a794ecd4aed7702dc417d530cc32d266c7835866f25914eee23363e2cc7","issues":["dist file not found — dist: line omitted (build first)"],"kind":"md","markdown":"## Constants\n\n<dl>\n<dt><a href=\"#unparseablePdf\">unparseablePdf</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Passes the signature gate (%PDF magic) but pdf-lib cannot parse it at all.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n\n## Functions\n\n<dl>\n<dt><a href=\"#handCraftedPdf\">handCraftedPdf(infoObject, kids, pageCount, mediaBox)</a> ⇒ <code>Buffer&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;</code></dt>\n<dd><p>Hand-crafts a minimal PDF with an optional /Info dict; usable where pdf-lib cannot (or chooses not to) emit one.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n\n<a name=\"unparseablePdf\"></a>\n\n## unparseablePdf\nPasses the signature gate (%PDF magic) but pdf-lib cannot parse it at all.\n\n**Kind**: global constant  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.service.spec.ts:288  \n<a name=\"handCraftedPdf\"></a>\n\n## handCraftedPdf(infoObject, kids, pageCount, mediaBox) ⇒ <code>Buffer&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;</code>\nHand-crafts a minimal PDF with an optional /Info dict; usable where pdf-lib cannot (or chooses not to) emit one.\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n**Returns**: <code>Buffer&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;</code> - The raw bytes of the hand-crafted PDF.  \n\n| Param | Type | Default | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| infoObject | <code>string</code> |  | The raw object body for the /Info dict (e.g. an empty-string CreationDate), or undefined for no /Info at all. |\n| kids | <code>string</code> |  | The raw contents of the /Kids array of the pages object (e.g. `'3 0 R'`, or `''` for zero pages). |\n| pageCount | <code>number</code> |  | The /Count value written into the pages object. |\n| mediaBox | <code>string</code> | <code>&quot;[0 0 200 200]&quot;</code> | The raw MediaBox array for the single page object. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.service.spec.ts:259  \n","symbols":2,"lastUsed":1795079891851},"tdata:packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.service.ts":{"doclets":[{"id":"PdfService","longname":"PdfService","name":"PdfService","kind":"member","scope":"global","description":"PDF feature service: builds documents, extracts text and reads metadata.","params":[],"meta":{"lineno":124},"order":4,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/resources/pdf/pdf.service.js:124 (approx.)","src":"packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.service.ts:101"},"level":0},{"id":"MAX_EXTRACT_PAGES","longname":"MAX_EXTRACT_PAGES","name":"MAX_EXTRACT_PAGES","kind":"constant","scope":"global","description":"Ceiling on extracted pages; plenty for legitimate decks, stops crafted fan-outs.","params":[],"meta":{"lineno":112},"order":2,"mdaics":{"dist":"packages/backend/dist/resources/pdf/pdf.service.js:75","src":"packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.service.ts:87"},"level":0},{"id":"readBody","longname":"readBody","name":"readBody","kind":"function","scope":"global","description":"Opens the uploaded body, bounded by the scanner cap.\nThe scanner only opens the source when ClamAV is enabled, so the service must too.","params":[{"description":"Normalized request context.","name":"cls","type":{"names":["NormalizedClsService"]}}],"returns":[{"description":"The body bytes, capped.","type":{"names":["Promise<Buffer<ArrayBufferLike>>"]}}],"meta":{"lineno":50},"async":true,"order":0,"