body, bounded by the scanner cap.\nThe scanner only opens the source when ClamAV is enabled, so the service must too.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt><a href=\"#assertPdfSignature\">assertPdfSignature(buffer)</a> ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;void&gt;</code></dt>\n<dd><p>Signature must be %PDF; closes the renamed-image and non-PDF holes.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt><a href=\"#isoOrString\">isoOrString(value)</a> ⇒ <code>string</code></dt>\n<dd><p>Normalizes pdf.js info dates to ISO strings (Date objects pass through toISOString).</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n\n<a name=\"PdfService\"></a>\n\n## PdfService\nPDF feature service: builds documents, extracts text and reads metadata.\n\n**Kind**: global variable  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.service.ts:101  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/pdf/pdf.service.js:124 (approx.)\n\n* [PdfService](#PdfService)\n    * [.build(body)](#PdfService+build) ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;Buffer&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;&gt;</code>\n    * [.extract()](#PdfService+extract) ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;{ format: string; metadata: { author: string; creationDate: string; creator: string; keywords: string; modificationDate: string; producer: string; subject: string; title: string; }; pageCount: number; structure: { pages: { page: number; text: string; }[]; }; text: string; }&gt;</code>\n    * [.metadata()](#PdfService+metadata) ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;{ author: string; creationDate: string; creator: string; encrypted: boolean; keywords: string; modificationDate: string; orientation: &quot;portrait&quot; \\| &quot;landscape&quot;; pageCount: number; pageSize: { height: number; width: number; }; producer: string; subject: string; title: string; format: string; }&gt;</code>\n\n<a name=\"PdfService+build\"></a>\n\n### pdfService.build(body) ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;Buffer&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;&gt;</code>\nBuilds a PDF from the payload in-process and returns the bytes.\n\n**Kind**: instance method of [<code>PdfService</code>](#PdfService)  \n**Returns**: <code>Promise&lt;Buffer&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;&gt;</code> - The .pdf bytes.  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| body | <code>{ pages: { elements: ({ [x: string]: any; text: string; type: &quot;text&quot;; x: number; y: number; align?: &quot;left&quot; \\| &quot;center&quot; \\| &quot;right&quot;; font?: string; size?: number; w?: number; } \\| { [x: string]: any; h: number; type: &quot;rect&quot;; w: number; x: number; y: number; dash?: boolean; strokeWidth?: number; } \\| { [x: string]: any; h: number; type: &quot;ellipse&quot;; w: number; x: number; y: number; strokeWidth?: number; } \\| { [x: string]: any; type: &quot;line&quot;; x1: number; x2: number; y1: number; y2: number; dash?: boolean; thickness?: number; } \\| { data: string; h: number; imageType: &quot;png&quot; \\| &quot;jpg&quot;; type: &quot;image&quot;; w: number; x: number; y: number; opacity?: number; } \\| { rows: (string \\| { [x: string]: any; text: string; align?: &quot;left&quot; \\| &quot;center&quot; \\| &quot;right&quot;; colSpan?: number; size?: number; })[][]; type: &quot;table&quot;; w: number; x: number; y: number; colWidths?: number[]; header?: boolean; } \\| { [x: string]: any; fieldType: &quot;text&quot; \\| &quot;checkbox&quot;; type: &quot;field&quot;; x: number; y: number; h?: number; value?: string; w?: number; } \\| { [x: string]: any; format: string; type: &quot;pageNumber&quot;; x: number; y: number; font?: string; size?: number; } \\| { type: &quot;pageBreak&quot;; })[]; margin: { bottom: number; left: number; right: number; top: number; }; orientation: &quot;portrait&quot; \\| &quot;landscape&quot;; size: &quot;a4&quot; \\| &quot;a3&quot; \\| &quot;a5&quot; \\| &quot;letter&quot; \\| &quot;legal&quot; \\| &quot;tabloid&quot;; }[]; embeddedFonts?: { [x: string]: any; data: string; }[]; metadata?: { author?: string; creationDate?: string; creator?: string; keywords?: string \\| string[]; language?: string; subject?: string; title?: string; }; }</code> | Validated build payload. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.service.ts:109  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/pdf/pdf.service.js:147 (approx.)\n<a name=\"PdfService+extract\"></a>\n\n### pdfService.extract() ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;{ format: string; metadata: { author: string; creationDate: string; creator: string; keywords: string; modificationDate: string; producer: string; subject: string; title: string; }; pageCount: number; structure: { pages: { page: number; text: string; }[]; }; text: string; }&gt;</code>\nExtracts text from an uploaded document, page by page.\n\n**Kind**: instance method of [<code>PdfService</code>](#PdfService)  \n**Returns**: <code>Promise&lt;{ format: string; metadata: { author: string; creationDate: string; creator: string; keywords: string; modificationDate: string; producer: string; subject: string; title: string; }; pageCount: number; structure: { pages: { page: number; text: string; }[]; }; text: string; }&gt;</code> - The parsed metadata plus per-page text.  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.service.ts:117  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/pdf/pdf.service.js:154 (approx.)\n<a name=\"PdfService+metadata\"></a>\n\n### pdfService.metadata() ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;{ author: string; creationDate: string; creator: string; encrypted: boolean; keywords: string; modificationDate: string; orientation: &quot;portrait&quot; \\| &quot;landscape&quot;; pageCount: number; pageSize: { height: number; width: number; }; producer: string; subject: string; title: string; format: string; }&gt;</code>\nNormalized PDF metadata for an uploaded document.\n\n**Kind**: instance method of [<code>PdfService</code>](#PdfService)  \n**Returns**: <code>Promise&lt;{ author: string; creationDate: string; creator: string; encrypted: boolean; keywords: string; modificationDate: string; orientation: &quot;portrait&quot; \\| &quot;landscape&quot;; pageCount: number; pageSize: { height: number; width: number; }; producer: string; subject: string; title: string; format: string; }&gt;</code> - Format plus the parsed properties.  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.service.ts:160  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/pdf/pdf.service.js:198 (approx.)\n<a name=\"MAX_EXTRACT_PAGES\"></a>\n\n## MAX\\_EXTRACT\\_PAGES\nCeiling on extracted pages; plenty for legitimate decks, stops crafted fan-outs.\n\n**Kind**: global constant  \nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.service.ts:87  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/pdf/pdf.service.js:75\n<a name=\"readBody\"></a>\n\n## readBody(cls) ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;Buffer&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;&gt;</code>\nOpens the uploaded body, bounded by the scanner cap.\nThe scanner only opens the source when ClamAV is enabled, so the service must too.\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n**Returns**: <code>Promise&lt;Buffer&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;&gt;</code> - The body bytes, capped.  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| cls | <code>NormalizedClsService</code> | Normalized request context. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.service.ts:24  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/pdf/pdf.service.js:20\n<a name=\"assertPdfSignature\"></a>\n\n## assertPdfSignature(buffer) ⇒ <code>Promise&lt;void&gt;</code>\nSignature must be %PDF; closes the renamed-image and non-PDF holes.\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| buffer | <code>Buffer&lt;ArrayBufferLike&gt;</code> | The buffered upload. |\n\nsrc: packages/backend/src/resources/pdf/pdf.service.ts:42  \ndist: packages/backend/dist/resources/pdf/pdf.service.js:33\n<a name=\"isoOrString\"></a>\n\n## isoOrString(value) ⇒ <code>string</code>\nNormalizes pdf.js info dates to ISO strings (Date objects pass through toISOString).\n\n**Kind**: global function  \n**Returns**: <code>string</code> - The ISO string, or the stringified value for non-Date inputs.  \n\n| Param | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| value | <code>string \\| Date</code> | The raw info-dict date value. |\n\nsrc: packa